| Payload | Fields |
| --- | --- |
| `SingleReleaseReleaseFundsPayload` | `{ contractId, releaseSigner }` |
| `MultiReleaseReleaseFundsPayload` | `{ contractId, releaseSigner, milestoneIndexes }` |

**Returns** `BuildTransactionResponse`: `{ unsignedXdr, txHash }`.

